Follow `AGENTS.md` as the canonical engineering guide.

Key constraints:
- Next.js App Router + TypeScript + pnpm only
- Groq is the AI provider; never expose API keys to the client
- LLM extracts signals; TypeScript calculates features
- No silent AI mocks on failure
- Keep demand and supply-risk features separate
- Prefer extending existing modules; avoid unnecessary dependencies
